#: src/dialoge.rs:806
msgid ""
"Classic archive manager for Querencia Desktop\n"
"modelled on File Roller 2.30.\n"
"\n"
"Reads every format libarchive knows, writes zip, tar.gz and tar.xz.\n"
"Alpha – not released for everyday use."
